# Optional. Visitors type their own contact email in the app; it is sent to NCBI E-utilities as
# the `email` parameter (with tool=ssHelper) and to Crossref as `mailto`, and saved only in their
# browser. When set, this value only pre-fills that field for local development. Leave it empty
# for public builds so no personal address ends up in the bundle. No NCBI account is needed.
# Copy this file to .env.local to use it.
VITE_NCBI_CONTACT_EMAIL=
